msgstr "The active release is missing or changed since the diagnostics started; comparison not run."

#: static-bridge.php:8056 static-bridge.php:8930
msgid "Avvia una nuova verifica quando non sono in corso pubblicazioni."
msgstr "Start a new check when no publishing is in progress."

#: static-bridge.php:8060 static-bridge.php:8935
