msgstr "Check the given path."

#: static-bridge.php:8065 static-bridge.php:8954
msgid "Verifica TLS, DNS e raggiungibilità della route dal processo PHP."
msgstr "Check TLS, DNS and reachability of the route from the PHP process."

#: static-bridge.php:8070
