msgstr "The saved URL is no longer a same-origin public route; no request was sent."

#: static-bridge.php:8716
msgid "Controlla il registro dell’export e non inserire URL esterne come target di diagnostica."
msgstr "Check the export log and do not enter external URLs as diagnostics targets."

