#: static-bridge.php:8725
msgid "Confronta questa singola richiesta con i log PHP, Nginx e del firewall applicativo. La release non è stata modificata."
msgstr "Compare this single request with the PHP, Nginx and application firewall logs. The release was not changed."

#. translators: %s: HTTP status code
